                ----mmaarrggiinn.



       [----ffrraammee__iinncclluuddee==_b_o_o_l]


              Valid values for _b_o_o_l are:



       yyeess

       ttrruuee

       oonn


              The frame itself is in the visible part.


       nnoo

       ffaallssee

       ooffff


              The frame itself is not necessarily in the visible part
                  (but it could be if other options cause it to be).




                The default value is yyeess


       ----iinncclluuddee==[[_x_1,_y_1;_x_2,_y_2; ...]


              The visible part is made large enough such that every point
                (_x_1,_y_1), (_x_2,_y_2), of the _i_n_p_u_t image is
                visible.  The meaning of _x and _y is determined by
